ImageMagick
-----------
src/extract.rs ports the logic of ImageMagick 7.1.2 (Q16 HDRI) that decides
what `magick "<img>[0]" -resize 25% -colors N -unique-colors txt:-` prints:
MagickCore/geometry.c (ParseMetaGeometry), MagickCore/resize.c
(ResizeImage, AcquireResizeFilter, SincFast, CubicBC, HorizontalFilter,
VerticalFilter), MagickCore/quantize.c (QuantizeImage, ClassifyImageColors,
ReduceImageColors, Reduce, PruneChild, PruneLevel, PruneToCubeDepth,
DefineImageColormap, ClosestColor, Riemersma/RiemersmaDither, and
SetGrayscaleImage's gray transform), MagickCore/histogram.c
(UniqueImageColors), MagickCore/color.c (GetColorTuple) and the Q16 HDRI
quantum helpers in MagickCore/quantum.h and pixel-accessor.h. The code was
translated from C to Rust and restructured (arena-allocated octree,
iterative helpers, multithreaded resize rows); the arithmetic and its order
are kept so results match bit for bit.

